st-title">高级格式语法</h1><div id="post-meta"><div class="meta-firstline"><span class="post-meta-date"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">发表于</span><time class="post-meta-date-created" datetime="2026-07-29T14:48:56.404Z" title="发表于 2026-07-29 22:48:56">2026-07-29</time><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><i class="fas fa-history fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">更新于</span><time class="post-meta-date-updated" datetime="2026-07-29T14:49:17.197Z" title="更新于 2026-07-29 22:49:17">2026-07-29</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" id="" data-flag-title=""><i class="far fa-eye fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">浏览量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i></span></span></div></div></div></header><main class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="container post-content" id="article-container"><p>本篇将向你介绍如何在笔记中使用高级格式语法。</p>
<h2 id="表格"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#表格"></a> 表格</h2>
<p>你可以使用竖线（<code>|</code>）和短横线（<code>-</code>）来创建表格。竖线用于分隔列，短横线用于定义列标题。</p>
<figure class="highlight md"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">| 名字 | 姓氏 |</span><br><span class="line">| ---- | ---- |</span><br><span class="line">| 麦克斯 | 普朗克 |</span><br><span class="line">| 玛丽 | 居里 |</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>名字</th>
<th>姓氏</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>麦克斯</td>
<td>普朗克</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>玛丽</td>
<td>居里</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>表格两侧的竖线是可选的。</p>
<p>单元格不需要与列完全对齐。每个标题行至少要有两个短横线。</p>
<figure class="highlight md"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">名字 | 姓氏</span><br><span class="line">-- | --</span><br><span class="line">麦克斯 | 普朗克</span><br><span class="line">玛丽 | 居里</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
<h3 id="格式化表格内容"><a class="markdownIt-Anchor" href="#格式化表格内容"></a> 格式化表格内容</h3>
<p>你可以使用<a  href="/syntax">基本格式语法</a>来为表格内的内容添加基本样式。</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>第一列</th>
